---
layout: base.njk
title: Wi-Fi QR code generator
description: Create a downloadable Wi-Fi QR code locally in your browser without sharing your network details.
permalink: /tools/wifi-qr-generator/index.html
toolScripts: true
qrLibrary: true
---
<header class="tool-page-header container">
  <a class="back-link" href="../index.html">← All tools</a>
  <p class="eyebrow">Wi-Fi · QR code</p>
  <h1>Wi-Fi QR generator.</h1>
  <p>Create a code that lets guests connect without typing the network name or password.</p>
</header>
<section class="tool-workspace container" data-wifi-tool>
  <form class="tool-panel" data-wifi-form novalidate>
    <div class="privacy-note"><strong>Private by design.</strong> Your network details stay in this browser and are never uploaded.</div>
    <div class="field-group"><label for="wifi-ssid">Network name (SSID)</label><input id="wifi-ssid" name="ssid" type="text" autocomplete="off" required placeholder="My Wi-Fi" aria-describedby="wifi-error"></div>
    <div class="field-group"><label for="wifi-security">Security</label><select id="wifi-security" name="security"><option value="WPA">WPA/WPA2/WPA3</option><option value="WEP">WEP</option><option value="nopass">No password</option></select></div>
    <div class="field-group" data-password-field><label for="wifi-password">Password</label><div class="password-input"><input id="wifi-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password"><button type="button" data-toggle-password aria-label="Show password">Show</button></div></div>
    <label class="check-field"><input name="hidden" type="checkbox"><span>Hidden network</span></label>
    <p class="form-error" id="wifi-error" data-wifi-error role="alert" hidden></p>
    <button class="button" type="submit">Generate QR code</button>
  </form>
  <div class="tool-results qr-results" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="qr-placeholder" data-qr-placeholder><span aria-hidden="true">QR</span><p>Your QR code will appear here.</p></div>
    <div data-qr-output hidden>
      <canvas data-qr-canvas width="640" height="640" aria-label="Generated Wi-Fi QR code"></canvas>
      <h2 data-qr-network></h2>
      <p>Scan with a phone or tablet camera to join this network.</p>
      <button class="button secondary" type="button" data-download-qr>Download PNG</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
